      },
      "message": "A1: restore the engine and satisfy the CLI run contract\n\nThe previous docs commit dropped engine/ and shared/, so the loop could not run.\n`tsx engine/cli.ts run --input --seed --n --out` writes result.json as a RunResult:\ndesigns, every result including constraint rejects, month rows when 50 <= n <= 1000,\nleaderDesignId, cliff.relativeDelta, and a StatusBar payload.\n\nOutlay is deposit + fitoutCost only. The six post-2024 quarter rows moved from\nshared/constants.ts to data/holdoutQuarters.ts so fitting does not read them\nfrom the frozen contract.\n\nCo-authored-by: devstar2637-hash <devstar2637-hash@users.noreply.github.com>",
