        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg+qImwGMCy/grKZ50VxRHz3VfWW\nAL3QNbzIy2Nwcn+nQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQPpsr0p74y7NWKAUZq6RRdMrQR3SNrZ2LGfUXR1hEK0hPM8d3p+fc4P9kdzgyspHeX\nSJtjo1gf9orkb6EOMARgM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----",
        "payload": "tree a951b1586de3a9821daed83e1675e7490c1aa943\nparent 2f9f7044e0da5de61288795bdfefbd478fae125c\nauthor Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1792122646 +0000\ncommitter Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1792122646 +0000\n\nA1: restore the engine and satisfy the CLI run contract\n\nThe previous docs commit dropped engine/ and shared/, so the loop could not run.\n`tsx engine/cli.ts run --input --seed --n --out` writes result.json as a RunResult:\ndesigns, every result including constraint rejects, month rows when 50 <= n <= 1000,\nleaderDesignId, cliff.relativeDelta, and a StatusBar payload.\n\nOutlay is deposit + fitoutCost only. The six post-2024 quarter rows moved from\nshared/constants.ts to data/holdoutQuarters.ts so fitting does not read them\nfrom the frozen contract.\n\nCo-authored-by: devstar2637-hash <devstar2637-hash@users.noreply.github.com>\n",
